{"path":"eval/cases/comprehende-57/sources/pr.json","ref":"603bbf138873e1fab673ef73d0a8238cc225190a","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":1,"text":"{"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":2,"text":"  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/pull/57\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":3,"text":"  \"number\": 57,"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":4,"text":"  \"title\": \"[Cursor] Replace hand-rolled review parser with Zod\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":5,"text":"  \"body\": \"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\\n## Why\\n\\n`parseReviewDocument` was ~500 lines of field-by-field checks next to `types.ts` and `review.schema.json`. Three copies of the same document. AGENTS.md already says to parse at the boundary with the schema as the source of truth.\\n\\n## Work\\n\\n- One Zod 4 schema for the review document. `ReviewDocument` is inferred from it. The hand-rolled `requiredString` / `extraKeys` stack is gone.\\n- `src/schema/review.schema.json` is generated from that schema (`pnpm generate:schema`). `pnpm sync:skill` still copies it. Drift is a unit test.\\n- Cross-field rules stay as refinements: duplicate ids, `dependsOn`, citations, pr-comment fields, transcript URLs, sources vs legacy `tickets`.\\n- Unknown `patch` and unknown source ids still fail. Other CLI error strings can differ.\\n- Zod is a runtime dependency. `pack-smoke` allows that one package and still refuses Pierre / UI libraries.\\n\\nOut of scope: `parseUnifiedDiff`, Pierre glue, image review, HTTP, git wrappers.\\n\\n## Review\\n\\nhttps://67qzjga9.vibedrop.site\\n\\nPosted by Cursor Grok 4.6 [cursor-grok-4.6]\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-f4386867-a6ef-4a20-84c4-749cfd164df4?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Web\\\" width=\\\"114\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-f4386867-a6ef-4a20-84c4-749cfd164df4&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"131\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\\n\\n\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":6,"text":"  \"user\": {"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":7,"text":"    \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":8,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":9,"text":"  \"merged_at\": \"2026-09-06T18:07:28Z\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"line":10,"text":"  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"ee0c6c0d32a18ee271d9a1947d5d21a2fc71cd7b\","},{"sha":"11108ceae77651c0215de73990b7a73c9211ee77","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789268342,"li